  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Support to civil society and citizens&#x2019; engagement project is implemented by the World Bank, and aims to enhance citizens&#x2019; participation in development activities, so as to provide services that are efficient and effective, and that meet the needs of Ethiopia&#x2019;s rural and urban populations. The objective is to strengthen Social Accountability systems and mechanisms. Key activities include institutional mapping, dissemination of local services information using local media, and support to citizens to become involved in local public service oversight and delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
